@startuml
title Lumen - Estructura del proyecto

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

package "src/app" as App {
  [Rutas publicas]
  [Rutas admin]
  [Redirect aliases]
}

package "src/components" as Components {
  [commerce]
  [admin]
  [layout]
  [motion]
  [ui]
}

package "src/features" as Features {
  [catalog]
  [cart]
  [orders]
  [discounts]
  [settings]
  [admin]
}

package "src/shared/storage" as Storage {
  [storage-port.ts]
  [repositories.ts]
  [browser-db.ts]
  [useBrowserRepositories.ts]
  [cart-events.ts]
}

package "src/data" as Data {
  [catalog.ts]
  [cart.ts]
  [admin.ts]
}

package "src/lib" as Lib {
  [format.ts]
}

App --> Components : compone UI y layout
App --> Features : delega flujos de negocio

Components --> Features : consume tipos y logica
Components --> Storage : clientes del navegador
Components --> Lib : formato y helpers

Features --> Data : seed y datos iniciales
Features --> Lib : utilidades compartidas
Features --> Storage : persistencia local

Storage --> Data : seeding inicial

note right of App
Entry points delgados con App Router.
Las paginas delegan el comportamiento
en componentes y modulos de dominio.
end note

note bottom of Features
La organizacion principal es por dominio
de negocio, no por tipo tecnico global.
end note

note bottom of Storage
Concentra contratos, creacion centralizada
de repositorios y adaptadores sobre IndexedDB.
end note

@enduml
